/*
 * Sharing of folders: resources
 *
 * The dialogs and the Ukrainian texts are Windows 10's own (ntshrui.dll.mui,
 * aclui.dll.mui, objsel.dll.mui of uk-UA: dialogs_uk.rcinc, written by
 * tools/res2rc.py). Two windows are Arctic's: Offline Settings, which the
 * Windows they were taken from does not have (cscui.dll is not in its
 * edition), and the frame of the sharing wizard, an Aero wizard there.
